  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tTime and Fees\n\t\tTime and Fees\n\n### Time and Fees: Time (Staff Access)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 10 Apr, 2024 at  1:18 PM\n\nThis article will provide a step by step guide on how to log, add and edit the time spent on a particular task specifically for staff users.\n\nRemember staff users can only view approved and rejected time logs \n\nAdd time:\n\nNavigation: Time and Fees > Timelog > +Add Time \n\nTo add time you can include the following:\n\nJob ID\n\nClient\n\nTask\n\nSubtask\n\nDate \n\nTime spent\n\nDescription\n\nOnce saved, it will create a new job and that will be stored in the unsubmitted section.\n\nUnsubmitted:\n\nIn order to submit for approval, you have to click on the unsubmitted time log and click ‘submit for approval’.\n\nYou can also send reminders here too.\n\nPFA: Pending for Approval\n\nOnce you submit for approval it will be in the PFA section and the admin/managers will be able to approve or reject these.\n\nApproved:\n\nAfter the time log has been approved it will then move into the approved section as shown above and if for some reason it has been rejected the time log would be seen in the rejected section instead. \n\nLocked Time:\n\nThe green locked time means you are no longer able to edit the time log as it has been approved.\n\nYou have to get in touch with the admin or manager to withdraw approval if you need to change this. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118370\">Time and Fees</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000199496\">Time and Fees</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Time and Fees: Time (Staff Access)\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 10 Apr, 2024 at  1:18 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<div class=\"fr-draggable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 41.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/5b9bfefc2dad498f91508a61679573ef?sid=fc57a1d4-3b26-4551-857a-11757e2cd8f7\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This article will provide a step by step guide on how to log, add and edit the time spent on a particular task specifically for staff users.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Remember staff users can only view approved and rejected time logs&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" 